    day=(weekday+5)%7 over the Gregorian weekday; cell value = mean(avg_speed_mps ?? max_speed_mps), drives with
    no start / non-positive speed skipped; convertSpeedFromSI = mps*3600/{1000 km/h, 1609.344 mph}; speedToColor =
    4-stop teal->cyan->amber->red gradient with web's integer-rounded lerp (empty cell = rgba(255,255,255,0.03));
    maxSpeed / totalDrives / peakCell reductions.
  Composition -> glass shell chrome (square.grid.3x3 icon + "Speed Heatmap" title + freshness chip + refresh +
    optional "Open") · standard/wide: summary line ("{count} drives" · "Peak avg {speed} {unit}") + Canvas 7×24
    heatmap (localized Mon-first day labels + hour ticks; wide widens both) + Slow->gradient->Fast legend ·
    compact 1-col: big peak number (0 dp, or em dash) + "Peak {unit}" caption.
